==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has only harmless enemies and a very weak base, so whatever units used for [[Q5. Matter of Luck|previous stages]] should be able to work.

